    "exact_reserve_text": "We regret to advise that the 2022 year of account will close with a loss of GBP 29.3m or US$36.6m being 13.9% of Stamp capacity. We have increased reserves on all years. The 2022 and prior gross reserves were increased by GBP 21.3m, partially offset by increased reinsurance recoveries of GBP 4.7m. During 4Q24 a number of claims have been agreed for settlement, but not yet, settled, on an ex-gratia basis against policies written under an aviation war consortium. Dale has a small following line participation. The increase in reserve is GBP 12.8m gross, GBP 5.1m net of reinsurance. We continue to see adverse development of claims predominantly in respect of two contracts and have strengthened gross (and net) reserves by GBP 5.4m for the 2022 and prior years.",
